---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy' }];
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Red Creek Outdoors"
  description="What Red Creek Outdoors LLC collects through this website, why, who processes it, and how to have your information removed. Plain language."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" crumbs={crumbs} lede="Short version: we collect what you type into the request form, use it to call you back, and don't sell it." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 20, 2026</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you send a request, we get what you type: your name, phone, email, dates, party size, property location,
        acreage, any marks you put on the property map, and your message. We also record the page you first landed on and the site that sent you, so we know which
        pages are working.
      </p>
      <p>
        Like every website, the server sees your IP address and browser details when you load a page. We don't use
        advertising trackers or sell anything about you.
      </p>

      <h2>Marketing permission</h2>
      <p>
        The hunt booking form asks, with separate boxes left unchecked, whether we may text, email or call you about future
        hunts and offers. We keep a record of what you checked, the wording you saw, the time, and the IP address and
        browser the request came from, so we can show what you agreed to. None of it is required to book. Reply STOP to
        any text, use the unsubscribe link in any email, or call us, and we stop.
      </p>

      <h2>Social posts on our home page</h2>
      <p>
        The home page shows our own Facebook and TikTok posts. We load the post text ourselves; the pictures load from
        Facebook's and TikTok's image servers, which see the request like any image on the web. We don't load Meta or
        TikTok tracking scripts.
      </p>

      <h2>Why</h2>
      <p>To answer your request, book your hunt or schedule trapping, and keep a record of the job.</p>

      <h2>Who handles it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Cloudflare hosts the site and stores form submissions.</li>
        <li>Resend delivers the email that tells us a request came in.</li>
        <li>Google Workspace holds our business email.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don't share your information with anyone else unless the law requires it.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Call {SITE.phone} and ask, and we'll tell you what we have on file about you or delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{SITE.legal}, {SITE.city}, Texas. {SITE.phone}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
